<caml:Content xmlns:caml="http://lc.ca.gov/legalservices/schemas/caml.1#"><p>The time limits specified in Article 8 (commencing with Section 1798. 30) may be extended to 60 days by the Franchise Tax Board if the following conditions exist:</p><p>(a)<span class="EnSpace"/>The request is made during the period January 1 through June 30; and </p><p>(b)<span class="EnSpace"/>The records requested are stored on magnetic tape.</p></caml:Content>